{"seq":1,"slug":"caloric-restriction-mimetics","title":"热量限制与模拟物：雷帕霉素、二甲双胍和NAD⁺前体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/intervention-strategies/caloric-restriction-mimetics","wordCount":1432,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"热量限制与模拟物-雷帕霉素-二甲双胍和nad-前体\">热量限制与模拟物：雷帕霉素、二甲双胍和NAD⁺前体</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>热量限制（Caloric Restriction, CR）是指在不造成营养不良的前提下，将热量摄入减少20-40%。自1935年McCay首次在大鼠中证明CR延寿以来，这一干预已在酵母、线虫、果蝇、小鼠、恒河猴等物种中被反复验证。CR模拟物（CR Mimetics）是试图在不实际减少进食的情况下，激活CR相同代谢通路的药物。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[热量限制 CR] --&gt; B[代谢信号改变]&#10;    B --&gt; C[mTOR抑制]&#10;    B --&gt; D[AMPK激活]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Sirtuin激活]&#10;    B --&gt; F[IIS下调]&#10;    C --&gt; G[自噬增强]&#10;    C --&gt; H[蛋白质合成减少]&#10;    D --&gt; I[线粒体生物合成]&#10;    D --&gt; J[脂肪酸氧化]&#10;    E --&gt; K[表观遗传稳定]&#10;    E --&gt; L[DNA修复增强]&#10;    F --&gt; M[胰岛素敏感性改善]&#10;    G --&gt; N[延长健康寿命]&#10;    H --&gt; N&#10;    I --&gt; N&#10;    K --&gt; N&#10;    M --&gt; N&#10;    N --&gt; O{CR模拟物}&#10;    O --&gt; P[雷帕霉素 → mTOR]&#10;    O --&gt; Q[二甲双胍 → AMPK]&#10;    O --&gt; R[NMN/NR → NAD+/Sirtuins]&#10;    O --&gt; S[亚精胺 → 自噬]\">graph TD\n    A[热量限制 CR] --&gt; B[代谢信号改变]\n    B --&gt; C[mTOR抑制]\n    B --&gt; D[AMPK激活]\n    B --&gt; E[Sirtuin激活]\n    B --&gt; F[IIS下调]\n    C --&gt; G[自噬增强]\n    C --&gt; H[蛋白质合成减少]\n    D --&gt; I[线粒体生物合成]\n    D --&gt; J[脂肪酸氧化]\n    E --&gt; K[表观遗传稳定]\n    E --&gt; L[DNA修复增强]\n    F --&gt; M[胰岛素敏感性改善]\n    G --&gt; N[延长健康寿命]\n    H --&gt; N\n    I --&gt; N\n    K --&gt; N\n    M --&gt; N\n    N --&gt; O{CR模拟物}\n    O --&gt; P[雷帕霉素 → mTOR]\n    O --&gt; Q[二甲双胍 → AMPK]\n    O --&gt; R[NMN/NR → NAD+/Sirtuins]\n    O --&gt; S[亚精胺 → 自噬]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CR模拟物</th>\n<th>主要靶点</th>\n<th>动物延寿证据</th>\n<th>人体试验状态(2026)</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>雷帕霉素</td>\n<td>mTORC1</td>\n<td>小鼠+9-14%(ITP)</td>\n<td>PEARL试验完成</td>\n<td>免疫抑制、伤口愈合延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二甲双胍</td>\n<td>AMPK/线粒体复合物I</td>\n<td>小鼠+5-6%</td>\n<td>TAME试验进行中</td>\n<td>胃肠道反应、可能削弱运动收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NMN</td>\n<td>NAD⁺→Sirtuins</td>\n<td>小鼠代谢改善(寿命数据有限)</td>\n<td>多项II期试验</td>\n<td>长期安全性未明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NR</td>\n<td>NAD⁺→Sirtuins</td>\n<td>类似NMN</td>\n<td>ChromaDex资助试验</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亚精胺</td>\n<td>自噬诱导</td>\n<td>小鼠+25%(饮食补充)</td>\n<td>观察性研究</td>\n<td>与某些药物相互作用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"热量限制的生物学机制\">热量限制的生物学机制</h2><p>CR的核心信号枢纽是四大营养感应通路的协调重编程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通路</th>\n<th>CR时状态</th>\n<th>下游效应</th>\n<th>延寿贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>mTORC1</td>\n<td>抑制</td>\n<td>自噬↑、翻译↓、SASP↓</td>\n<td>主要(约占40%)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMPK</td>\n<td>激活</td>\n<td>线粒体生合成↑、脂肪酸β氧化↑</td>\n<td>重要(约占25%)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sirtuins(SIRT1-7)</td>\n<td>激活(NAD⁺↑)</td>\n<td>组蛋白去乙酰化、DNA修复↑</td>\n<td>重要(约占20%)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IIS(Insulin/IGF-1)</td>\n<td>下调</td>\n<td>FOXO激活 → 抗氧化/修复基因↑</td>\n<td>辅助(约占15%)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CALERIE试验（Comprehensive Assessment of Long-term Effects of Reducing Intake of Energy）是人类最大规模的CR随机对照试验。两年25% CR在健康非肥胖成人中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>降低心血管风险因子（胆固醇、血压、CRP）</li>\n<li>改善胰岛素敏感性</li>\n<li>减少氧化应激标志物</li>\n<li>但存在骨密度下降和肌肉质量减少的副作用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"雷帕霉素-mtor抑制与pearl试验突破\">雷帕霉素：mTOR抑制与PEARL试验突破</h2><p>雷帕霉素（Rapamycin/Sirolimus）是mTORC1的别构抑制剂，通过与FKBP12结合后阻断mTOR激酶活性。</p>\n<p><strong>ITP数据（小鼠）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实验</th>\n<th>给药起始年龄</th>\n<th>雄性延寿</th>\n<th>雌性延寿</th>\n<th>组合药物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ITP 2009</td>\n<td>600天(≈60岁)</td>\n<td>+9%</td>\n<td>+14%</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ITP 2016</td>\n<td>270天(≈25岁)</td>\n<td>+23%</td>\n<td>+26%</td>\n<td>+ 阿卡波糖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ITP 2022</td>\n<td>270天</td>\n<td>+28%</td>\n<td>+34%</td>\n<td>+ 阿卡波糖(高剂量)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>PEARL试验（2026年发布全年数据）</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[PEARL试验设计] --&gt; B[114名健康成人 50-85岁]&#10;    B --&gt; C[随机分3组]&#10;    C --&gt; D[安慰剂组]&#10;    C --&gt; E[5mg/周]&#10;    C --&gt; F[10mg/周]&#10;    D --&gt; G[48周随访]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[主要结局]&#10;    H --&gt; I[瘦体重变化]&#10;    H --&gt; J[内脏脂肪变化]&#10;    H --&gt; K[疼痛评分]&#10;    H --&gt; L[生物年龄标志物]\">graph LR\n    A[PEARL试验设计] --&gt; B[114名健康成人 50-85岁]\n    B --&gt; C[随机分3组]\n    C --&gt; D[安慰剂组]\n    C --&gt; E[5mg/周]\n    C --&gt; F[10mg/周]\n    D --&gt; G[48周随访]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[主要结局]\n    H --&gt; I[瘦体重变化]\n    H --&gt; J[内脏脂肪变化]\n    H --&gt; K[疼痛评分]\n    H --&gt; L[生物年龄标志物]</pre><p>PEARL试验关键发现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>10mg/周组内脏脂肪显著减少，瘦体重保持</li>\n<li>自评健康状况和疼痛评分改善（剂量依赖性）</li>\n<li>安全性：无严重免疫事件（间歇低剂量方案）</li>\n<li>生物年龄标志物呈剂量依赖性改善趋势</li>\n</ul>\n<p>间歇低剂量策略的关键在于：仅抑制mTORC1（促衰老）而不持续抑制mTORC2（免疫功能所需）。高剂量持续用药（器官移植剂量）的免疫抑制问题在间歇低剂量方案中大幅减轻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二甲双胍-tame试验与争议\">二甲双胍：TAME试验与争议</h2><p>二甲双胍是全球使用最广泛的2型糖尿病药物，其潜在抗衰老机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>通路</th>\n<th>下游效应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线粒体复合物I抑制</td>\n<td>降低ATP/AMP比值</td>\n<td>AMPK激活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMPK激活</td>\n<td>磷酸化下游底物</td>\n<td>线粒体生合成↑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mTOR间接抑制</td>\n<td>AMPK→TSC2→mTOR</td>\n<td>自噬↑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗炎</td>\n<td>NF-κB抑制</td>\n<td>炎症因子↓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肠道微生物调节</td>\n<td>增加产短链脂肪酸菌</td>\n<td>代谢改善</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>TAME试验</strong>（Targeting Aging with Metformin）由Nir Barzilai领导，是FDA首次批准以「延缓衰老」作为临床终点的试验设计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>入组3000名65-79岁非糖尿病老人</li>\n<li>主要终点：首次出现年龄相关疾病（心血管事件、癌症、痴呆、死亡）的复合指标</li>\n<li>若成功，将为「衰老」作为药物适应症建立监管先例</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>争议</strong>：2024年发表的研究表明，二甲双胍可能削弱运动带来的肌肉适应性收益（减弱运动后线粒体生物合成信号）。这提示对于已有规律运动习惯的人群，二甲双胍的净收益可能被其「运动钝化」效应部分抵消。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nad-前体-nmn与nr\">NAD⁺前体：NMN与NR</h2><p>NAD⁺（烟酰胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸）是细胞代谢的核心辅酶，参与500+种酶促反应。随年龄增长，NAD⁺水平显著下降（60岁时约为年轻时的50%）。</p>\n<p>NAD⁺下降的机制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>NAD</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mtext>消耗</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mtext>CD38</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>主要消耗者(衰老时表达↑)</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>PARPs</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>DNA修复消耗</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>Sirtuins</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>去乙酰化消耗</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NAD}^+ \\text{消耗} = \\underbrace{\\text{CD38}}_{\\text{主要消耗者(衰老时表达↑)}} + \\underbrace{\\text{PARPs}}_{\\text{DNA修复消耗}} + \\underbrace{\\text{Sirtuins}}_{\\text{去乙酰化消耗}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NAD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">消耗</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2313em;vertical-align:-1.548em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.627em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">主要消耗者</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">衰老时表达</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">↑)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CD38</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.548em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DNA</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">修复消耗</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PARPs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">去乙酰化消耗</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sirtuins</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>补充策略的比较：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>前体</th>\n<th>转化路径</th>\n<th>生物利用度</th>\n<th>人体数据</th>\n<th>价格(月)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NMN</td>\n<td>NMN → NAD⁺(NMNAT)</td>\n<td>口服可吸收</td>\n<td>血液NAD⁺升高确认</td>\n<td>¥300-800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NR</td>\n<td>NR → NMN → NAD⁺</td>\n<td>口服良好</td>\n<td>类似NMN</td>\n<td>¥400-600</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>烟酸(NA)</td>\n<td>NA → NAAD → NAD⁺</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>可引起潮红</td>\n<td>¥50-100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NAM</td>\n<td>NAM → NMN → NAD⁺</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高剂量可能抑制Sirtuins</td>\n<td>¥50-100</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>截至2026年，NAD⁺前体（NMN/NR）已确认能在人体中提升血液NAD⁺水平，但尚无大规模随机对照试验证明其延长寿命或显著改善硬性健康终点。长期安全性数据仍然不足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>热量限制是衰老干预的「黄金标准」，但其在人类中的实践困难催生了CR模拟物策略。雷帕霉素通过PEARL试验在人体中迈出了关键一步；二甲双胍的TAME试验若成功将改变衰老的医学地位；NAD⁺前体虽机制清晰但临床证据仍待完善。这些干预手段的共同点是靶向营养感应通路——这也印证了衰老标志物框架中「营养感应失调」作为枢纽节点的核心地位。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热量限制与模拟物：雷帕霉素、二甲双胍和NAD⁺前体","id":"热量限制与模拟物-雷帕霉素-二甲双胍和nad-前体"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"热量限制的生物学机制","id":"热量限制的生物学机制"},{"level":2,"text":"雷帕霉素：mTOR抑制与PEARL试验突破","id":"雷帕霉素-mtor抑制与pearl试验突破"},{"level":2,"text":"二甲双胍：TAME试验与争议","id":"二甲双胍-tame试验与争议"},{"level":2,"text":"NAD⁺前体：NMN与NR","id":"nad-前体-nmn与nr"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"衰老标志物：十二大Hallmarks全景解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology/hallmarks-of-aging"},"next":{"title":"Senolytics疗法：靶向清除衰老细胞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/intervention-strategies/senolytics-therapy"}}